entityDescription:
Lightigo s.r.o. is a start-up company focused on the development and production of analytical instruments for Laser-Induced Breakdown Spectroscopy, one of today&rsquo;s most promising techniques of elemental analysis. We
were founded in August 2019 by researchers and hardware developers who have long-term experience with R&D in the field of LIBS. The ownership of the company is fully in the hands of the core R&D team.

&ldquo;Our Mission is to introduce the benefits of LIBS to the market in the form of analytical instruments designed with the accent on the high performance, stability, and user experience.&ldquo;

GAP Consult is privately owned Bulgarian company, established in 2006 and specialized in geospatial domain: design, development, implementation, training and maintenance of GIS and other information systems; analysis and data processing; development of technical specifications of information systems.
We implement systems to arrive at comprehensive solutions and and high quality end products: from data to information, from desktop to mobile, from on-premise to cloud solutions.
How we do that:
- We rely on our QualityManagement System, in compliance to the international standard ISO 9001:2015. The scope of certification is: design, development, implementation, training and maintenance of GIS (Geographic Information Systems) and other information systems; analysis and data processing; development of technical specifications of information systems.
- Diversification: we have worked in many different areas of geospatial industry - environmental and water management, agricultural development, climate change, etc.
- Experience: we have successfully completed project in more than 20 countries - Bulgaria, Moldova, Republic of Maldives, Italy, Turkmenistan, Romania, Serbia, etc.
- Partnerships: we work with private companies, governmental institutions and international development agencies, NGOs and universities.
- Networking: we maintain and operate as a network of excellence, based on partnerships with project managers, university professors, experienced developers, GIS analytical staff, and variety of other experts in different applied areas, both as a core stuff and external consultants.
- Technological excellence: our technological know-how is based on the geospatial and IT industry, using both proprietary and open-source products.

SERVICES
- Business analysis tailored to geospatial applications;
- Complex GIS system design;
- Development of integrated GIS: desktop/server/web/mobile;
- On-demand open source geo applications (Saas/PaaS);
- Spatial data development, integration and support;
- Spatial analysis, modelling and digital cartography;
- User training and maintenance.
The company has it own cloud server infrastructure based on the Amazon EC2 platform and Leaseweb Cloud provider for test and management platforms, for development purposes and SaaS GIS solutions.
